@startuml
participant Client
participant "FHIR API" as API
alt No assignment exists
Client->API: POST /Task
API->API: Create in-progress BePerformerTask
API-->Client: 201 Created
else Assignment exists
Client->API: PATCH /Task/{executionID}
API->API: Add executionPeriod.start
API-->Client: 200 OK
end
@enduml
